          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 82872,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang disimpan oleh variabel <code>orders</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_number = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"orders = customers + order_number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(orders)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"Jess\", \"Mike\", \"Lynn\", 3, 1, 2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sebuah angka</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[3, 1, 2, \"Jess\", \"Mike\", \"Lynn\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"Jess\", \"Mike\", \"Lynn\", 3, 1, 2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah <code>orders</code> dibuat, apa yang diberikan <code>orders[3]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_number = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"orders = customers + order_number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(orders)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Lynn\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Error karena indeks <code>3</code> berasal dari list kedua</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Save in variable",
            "id": 82876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gabungkan kedua list sehingga <code>day_1</code> berada di urutan pertama, lalu simpan hasilnya ke dalam variabel <code>overview</code> untuk digunakan nanti.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"day_1 = [\" /><text value=\"3.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"day_2 = [\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"overview = day_1 + day_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(overview)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[3.5, 2, 4, 7, 1]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>overview</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, lalu <code>day_1</code>, <code>+</code>, <code>day_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan list yang digabungkan dalam <code>overview</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>[3.5, 2, 4, 7, 1]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"day_1 = [\" /><text value=\"3.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"day_2 = [\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"overview = day_1 + day_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(overview)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"day_1[0]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[3.5, 2, 4, 7, 1]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>overview</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, <code>day_1</code>, <code>+</code>, dan terakhir <code>day_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82879,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan di console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"code = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(code.count(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[3, 0, 2, 2, 0, 1, 0]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Console di bawah ini menampilkan hasil untuk list seperti yang tertulis.</p><p>Jika satu <code>0</code> lagi ditambahkan ke <code>code</code> sebelum baris <code>print</code> dijalankan, apa yang akan ditampilkan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"code = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(code.count(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, karena <code>count()</code> menggunakan list asli</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>8</code>, karena <code>count()</code> mengembalikan panjang list</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element to count",
            "id": 82880,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(flavors.count())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Harus ada nilai di antara tanda kurung <code>count()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang salah dengan kode ini</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Daftarnya terlalu panjang</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Harus ada nilai di antara tanda kurung <code>count()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Method <code>count()</code> memerlukan nilai yang ingin kita hitung di dalam tanda kurung.</p><p>Baris mana yang menampilkan jumlah kemunculan <code>\"vanilla\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(flavors.count())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(flavors.count(\"vanilla\"))</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(flavors.count())</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(flavors.count[\"vanilla\"])</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>print(flavors.count(\"vanilla\"))</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Boolean",
            "id": 88419,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan di console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"schedule = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" schedule)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kedua nilai <code>\"ballet\"</code> dihapus sebelum pemeriksaan keanggotaan berjalan, apa yang ditampilkan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"schedule = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" schedule)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code>, karena pemeriksaan keanggotaan mengembalikan jumlah kecocokan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Error karena nilai yang dicari tidak ada</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
